BT 1 0 0 1 0 50 Tm 1.001205 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Impinj Monza 4 QT tags support the QT command, which can modify the QT Control word of the tag. Setting the) Tj T* 0 Tw .427459 Tw (QT) Tj /F4 10 Tf (SR bit can shorten the operation distance of the tag in the Open and Secured states or when it is about to enter) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.236894 Tw (the Open and Secured states. Modifying the QT) Tj /F1 10 Tf (MEM bit can switch the label to use Public Memory Map \(Public) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.064119 Tw (Memory Map\) or Private Memory Map \(Private Memory Map\). Before this instruction, the Select parameter should be) Tj T* 0 Tw (set to select the specified label for operation.) Tj T* ET
